TY  - JOUR
ID  - arxiv-hep-th-0006183v1
AU  - Bonini, M.
AU  - Tricarico, E.
TI  - Fine-tuning and the Wilson renormalization group
DA  - D:20210723
UR  - https://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/0006183
AB  - We use the Wilson renormalization group (RG) formulation to solve the ﬁne-tuning proce- dure needed in renormalization schemes breaking the gauge symmetry. To illustrate this method we systematically compute the non-invariant couplings of the ultraviolet action of the SU(2) pure Yang-Mills theory at one-loop order.
ER  - 
